  "stageId": "st_07-04",
  "title": "??:??:??",
  "storyCode": "7-20",
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_07-04.txt",
  "sourceHash": "576b51b7c325392053440bc617b0e08e50833e1dd9fbc2f6181bba22b75f694d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kashchey",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I can return her to you, Wei."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Stop!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Don't do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kashchey",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh? You and your mighty executioners have made my life hell."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kashchey",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Of course I'm willing to return her to you... But the cuffs on her body will tear Lungmen in half."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Damn you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kashchey",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wei, this is the method you used against me. The way you forced me out of Lungmen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kashchey",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But now, our roles are reversed. I'm the guest, as well as the poisoner."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Kashchey. You killed my brother."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kashchey",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, no, Wei. You slew your own brother."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kashchey",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My role is irrelevant. Your brother's tragedy may have come from a Unicorn's secret orders, or from the wrath of a Lung. Whether it was me who leaked the news... ultimately, does not matter."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kashchey",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's important, Wei, the one thing you mustn't forget... is that your Chi Xiao drank his blood. You did it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kashchey",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Chi Xiao, the dragonslaying sword. And who is it that this blade slew? Your friends. Your family. Your people."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kashchey",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Dragonslaying sword? How ironic that your people forged a weapon that would be turned against its own kind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You've gone too far."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kashchey",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Very well. I offer you a choice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kashchey",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Choose. Slay me, and take back your niece, but lose your city as a result. Or, let us walk free."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kashchey",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't draw that sword. You know the consequences."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Grinds teeth audibly)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kashchey",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Relax, Wei. I've let you choose your own fate. If you don't take my generous offer, then you and I both, all your citizens, and these two lovely sisters... will all perish."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What are you scheming?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kashchey",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wei, old Wei... I know you well. Too well."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kashchey",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You've always had a choice, isn't that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kashchey",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What will your precious citizens think when they hear that their lives have been placed upon a scale? And on the other side... is a young dragon whose name they've never heard."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kashchey",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As for me, I don't even have a reason to hurt her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Since I was negligent enough to let you step foot back into this city, there's no reason to let you leave again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tal!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kashchey",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh really?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'll kill you myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kashchey",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now, now. There's no need for that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kashchey",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My life is not yours to take."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kashchey",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_060",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "By the way, you can save her before I put the handcuffs on her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kashchey",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_060",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But you'll also have to think about defending against me. Defeating me. Striking me down. Annihilating me... And, what I am going to do next."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kashchey",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_060",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wei, you're actually afraid of me, aren't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She's here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Finally."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'll kill her myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Confessarius, answer me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Leader of Reunion, is there any value in forming an alliance?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Confessarius",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why ask me about things that you know very well, Your Majesty?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Confessarius",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A youth with no possessions, background, or capital cannot possibly seek to take an important Ursus city alone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Confessarius",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The uninfected rulers know not what to make of her actions."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Confessarius",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They will panic, overreact, and try to resolve the chaos through more destruction — and use the chaos caused by the Infected as a front."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Confessarius",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But, we Sarkaz know better."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Regent",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What do you think of the team she finally left here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Confessarius",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They are unworthy, Your Majesty. As you foresaw, there is no hope for them. They are not trained soldiers, unable to cause the violence that we seek."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Regent",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Eliminating them will not sever Talulah's power. We lack an opportunity to take her out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Confessarius",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Right, Your Majesty."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Confessarius",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The situation that she fomented and the power she wielded to force the issue... shows that she is no one-eyed leader among the blind, or some pampered princeling awaiting the throne."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Confessarius",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She is a conspirator."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Regent",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Even if that is the case, I require a comprehensive response from the Sarkaz."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Confessarius",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "In that case, I have two bits of good news. First, we already have a lead on our search for the Lord of Fiends."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Confessarius",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Rhodes Island hasn't yet been manipulated by foreign forces."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Regent",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't waste time. We need her to begin right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Confessarius",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Please do not be angered, and hear me out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Confessarius",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'She' is ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Regent",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That power is rightfully ours."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Regent",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The true King of Sarkaz is mightier than the heir of any unknown name."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
